{%- comment -%}
  /pages/booking - "What can we help with?" (redesign 2026-11-13; popup
  2026-11-14, owner: the chosen option opens as a popup).

  The page shows the three choices. assets/pt-book.js draws them here and
  each opens the booking popup (the same sheet every Book button opens) on
  that choice; the whole request then happens in the popup:
    - New tires or wheels -> Tires / Wheels / Packages tabs like the home
      search: Tires is the site's Find your size search (type the size, or
      width / aspect / rim dropdowns, or by vehicle) drawn by
      assets/pt-size-sheet.js (PTSizeSheet.inline); Wheels and Packages are
      snippets/pt-wheel-search, rendered below and moved into the popup.
    - My own tires / Repair or service -> step 1 of the form on that path.
    - ?service=<slug or alias> -> the popup opens at the job details on
      load; aliases such as installation / tire-install / swap / balance /
      road-force / repair / sensor resolve through the form's alias map, an
      unknown slug opens step 1 with "Pick the service you need."
    - ?location=sw|ne preselects the shop for the time step.
  Closing the popup comes back to the choices. The previous four-step page
  lives in the rollback copy of this file.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hero_heading = section.settings.hero_heading | default: 'Request a service'
  assign hero_sub     = section.settings.hero_sub     | default: 'Tell us what you need, pick a time. We confirm by email within the day.'
-%}
{{ 'pt-book.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="pt-bp">
  <header class="pt-bp__hero">
    <p class="pt-bp__eyebrow">42 Ave SW &middot; Edmonton Trail NE</p>
    <h1 class="pt-bp__title">{{ hero_heading }}</h1>
    <p class="pt-bp__sub">{{ hero_sub }}</p>
  </header>

  <div class="pt-bp__shell">
    <div class="pt-bp__form" data-ptb-page>
      <noscript>
        <p class="pt-bp__noscript">Online requests need JavaScript. Call 42 Ave SW at <a href="tel:+14034524283">(403) 452-4283</a> or Edmonton Trail NE at <a href="tel:+18253954024">(825) 395-4024</a>.</p>
      </noscript>
      <p class="pt-bp__loading" aria-hidden="true">Loading the booking form&hellip;</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The "New tires or wheels" popup's Wheels and Packages tabs: the same wheel
    search as the home page's (snippets/pt-wheel-search), rendered here once
    and moved into the popup by assets/pt-book.js. Hidden until then.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign bp_pkg_page = pages['wheel-package'] -%}
  <div class="pt-bp__wheelsrc" data-ptb-wheelsrc hidden>
    <div data-ptb-ws="wheels">{% render 'pt-wheel-search', compact: true %}</div>
    {%- if bp_pkg_page != empty -%}
      <div data-ptb-ws="packages">{% render 'pt-wheel-search', compact: true, package_url: bp_pkg_page.url %}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

</section>

<script src="{{ 'pt-book.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer" data-ptb-js></script>

{% stylesheet %}
.pt-bp {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f7f7f7 100%);
  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  color: #111;
  padding-bottom: 6rem;
}
.pt-bp__hero { text-align: center; padding: 3.2rem 1.6rem 2rem; max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; }
.pt-bp__eyebrow { color: #dc2626; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 .6rem; }
.pt-bp__title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 4.6rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.02; margin: 0 0 .8rem; color: #111; }
.pt-bp__sub { color: #57534e; font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
.pt-bp__shell { max-width: 108rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.6rem; }
.pt-bp__loading { margin: 0; padding: 4rem 0; text-align: center; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #57534e; }
.pt-bp__noscript { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; }
/* The three choices (drawn by pt-book.js); each opens the booking popup. */
.pt-bp .ptb--pick {
  max-width: 96rem; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--rd-line, #e7e5e0); border-radius: var(--rd-r-xl, 18px);
  box-shadow: var(--rd-shadow-card, 0 12px 30px rgba(17, 17, 17, .08));
  padding: 2rem 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.6rem;
}
.pt-bp .ptb--pick .ptb-tile { position: relative; min-height: 4.4rem; padding-right: 4.4rem; }
.pt-bp .ptb--pick .ptb-tile.ptb-tile:hover { border-color: var(--rd-ink, #111); }
.pt-bp .ptb-tile__go {
  position: absolute; right: 1.4rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-90deg);
  display: inline-flex; color: var(--rd-red, #dc2626); font-style: normal;
}
.pt-bp .ptb-pick__top { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
.pt-bp .ptb-pick__call { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--rd-muted, #57534e); }
.pt-bp .ptb-pick__call a { color: var(--rd-ink, #111); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .pt-bp__hero { padding: 4.8rem 3.2rem 2.8rem; }
  .pt-bp__shell { padding: 0 3.2rem; }
  .pt-bp .ptb--pick { padding: 2.8rem 3rem; gap: 2rem; }
  .pt-bp .ptb--pick .ptb-tile { padding-right: 1.8rem; padding-bottom: 4.4rem; }
  .pt-bp .ptb-tile__go { top: auto; bottom: 1.4rem; transform: rotate(-90deg); }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Booking page",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hero_heading",
      "label": "Hero heading",
      "default": "Request a service"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "hero_sub",
      "label": "Hero subheading",
      "default": "Tell us what you need, pick a time. We confirm by email within the day."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Booking page" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
